# --- Not published -------------------------------------------------------------
# A separate deliverable by another writer: the proposal document, its
# screenshots and its build. Not application code, and 3 MB of binary documents
# is weight nobody clones this repository for.
/docs/proposal/
/tools/proposal-cleanup.py
/tools/proposal-shots.mjs

# The Caddy block that served this hostname before `enable` gave it to this app:
# host state, like .env, not source. It stays on disk because
# `deploy/host-cpns.sh disable` writes it back, and it stays out of the
# repository because publishing it would publish whose page this one replaced.
/deploy/caddy/*.static-clone.caddy
